<title>ITALY: KM Europa sees 96 pretax over 100 mln DEM.</title>
<headline>KM Europa sees 96 pretax over 100 mln DEM.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian SMI group's KM Europa Metal expects to post 1996 pre-tax profit of over 100 million marks and to see a 30 percent increase in 1997.</p>
<p>The Osnabrueck-based non-ferrous metals group gave the details in a statement released in Italy to coincide with a German company presentation.</p>
<p>In 1995, KM posted group pre-tax profit of 100 million marks on turnover of 3.9 billion marks.</p>
<p>The 1997 forecast was based on expectations of &quot;moderate market growth&quot;, the statement said.</p>
<p>In Frankfurt, KM stock closed 7.5 marks up at 135 marks.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
